### Toggle the stuck-segment demo: activates (blocks segment 0 and starts publishing) or deactivates
POST http://localhost:8080/diagnostics/stuck-segment/toggle

###

### Toggle, explicitly targeting a different segment (0-3) to block on activation
POST http://localhost:8080/diagnostics/stuck-segment/toggle?targetSegment=2

###

### Check status: active flag, currently targeted (blocked) segment key, and per-key handled counts
GET http://localhost:8080/diagnostics/stuck-segment/status

###
